    <briefdescription>
<para>Move CK constraints from old space to the new one. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Unlike <ref refid="classRebuildCkConstraints" kindref="compound">RebuildCkConstraints</ref>, this operation doesn&apos;t perform ck constraints rebuild. This may be used in scenarios where space format doesn&apos;t change i.e. on index alter or space trim. </para>    </detaileddescription>
